quests.description:
Bryan (EvilAbyss 609,633) asked you to raze the mountain of Grievance (40,000 meters high) to the ground by killing monsters in the abyss, so that dead souls will be released from suffering. Killing different kinds of monsters will lead to different results. When you complete the quest, report back to Bryan, and then go find Angela to continue your trial. Notes:
When you kill each Vale Demon, Singing Serpent, Blue Fiend, Wind Ape, Wood Hades, Fury Bat, Bone Skeleton or Angry Beast, the hill of grievance will sink for 1 meter;
 each Mud Demon, Roaring Serpent, Red Fiend, Rain Ape, Water Hades, Cruel Bat, Lame Skeleton, Sensitive Beast for 6 meters;
each Abyss Demon, Crying Serpent, White Fiend, Lightning Ape, Earth Hades, Vicious Bat, Carrion Skeleton, Crazy Beast for 20 meters;
each Demon Lord, Serpent Spirit, Fiend Lord, Fury Ape, Hades Lord, Demon Bat, Fury Skeleton, Fearless Beast for 500 meters.

